sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: AP2 failure: invalid_credential on a broken mandate chain
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: AP2 failure: invalid_credential on a broken mandate chain. 2 participants: Shopping Agent and Credential Provider. 4 steps, 2 crossing a trust boundary, 1 failure branch. Based on ap2 v0.2 (2026-04-28). Step 1: Shopping Agent to Credential Provider: Present open and closed Payment Mandates. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Credential Provider to Credential Provider: Verify the chain under Delegate SD-JWT. If The chain verifies but the closed mandate changes a value the open mandate fixed, such as the payee: invalid_mandate: the mandate does not approve this action terminal. Step 3: Credential Provider to Shopping Agent: Payment Receipt: status Error, invalid_credential. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Shopping Agent to Shopping Agent: Record the rejection.
  autonumber
  participant p_sa as Shopping Agent
  participant p_cp as Credential Provider
  p_sa->>p_cp: Present open and closed Payment Mandates
  Note over p_sa,p_cp: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_cp->>p_cp: Verify the chain under Delegate SD-JWT
  else The chain verifies but the closed mandate changes a value the open mandate fixed, such as the payee
    Note over p_cp: invalid_mandate: the mandate does<br/>not approve this action#59; terminal.
  end
  p_cp->>p_sa: Payment Receipt: status Error, invalid_credential
  Note over p_cp,p_sa: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_sa->>p_sa: Record the rejection
